disrepair, fires break out, the weather turns turbulent, and nature itself withers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4221910/extras/6199bca2e26e15d4a123377be4d01982.avif?t=1764712472\" width=780 height=92 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4221910/extras/62d43e0b21650ca2d333a397ff180397.poster.avif?t=1764712472\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4221910/extras/62d43e0b21650ca2d333a397ff180397.webm?t=1764712472\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a village where every NPC has a unique life, schedule, and behavior. Get to know them as you treat them, or watch them succumb to sickness, or perhaps, to your own malpractice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4221910/extras/44ead051c4af0069859919612d50f1b4.avif?t=1764712472\" width=780 height=92 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4221910/extras/58bc103465f73bf12a190f5051e9b235.poster.avif?t=1764712472\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4221910/extras/58bc103465f73bf12a190f5051e9b235.webm?t=1764712472\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4221910/extras/58bc103465f73bf12a190f5051e9b235.mp4?t=1764712472\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you bear the burden of the plague alone or share the task in 4-player co-op, the work never ends. However, when the pressure mounts, you can always find a moment of peace in the tavern, play the lute, or throw some dice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "From an unknown quack to a reputable Plague Doctor, watch the plague unfold before your eyes. Gather ingredients, brew remedies, expand your clinic, and perform surgeries alone or up to 4 player co-op. Will you uphold the Hippocratic Oath... or watch the world rot and darken with every death.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French<strong>*</strong>, Italian<strong>*</strong>, German<strong>*</strong>, Spanish - Spain<strong>*</strong>, Japanese<strong>*</strong>, Korean<strong>*</strong>, Simplified Chinese<strong>*</strong>, Traditional Chinese<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4221910/7d83cdb4dbaba542e6163595d305dd85f553b737/header.jpg?t=1764712472", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4221910/58105dedf119c829a97b47506bb9e01b4e6e0f5e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764712472", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4221910/58105dedf119c829a97b47506bb9e01b4e6e0f5e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764712472", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-8400, AMD Ryzen 5 2600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1060 (6GB), AMD Radeon RX 580<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li